  "description": "VUVLEF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H119 Dy5 N4 O27,C1 H4 O1,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.539-3.659 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.77-98.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C81H127Dy5N4O30. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
